tps://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50535591/sec-standardized-nil-contracts-unfair-players-agents-say","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Max Olson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Waiver approved allowing Army, Navy to play 13th game in 2027","description":"The waiver will allow Army and Navy to play 12 games apiece before the College Football Playoff selections are made and keep their rivalry game.","published":"2026-11-19T23:50:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50535192/waiver-approved-army-navy-13th-game-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Jake Trotter","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"James Madison moving to American Conference in 2027","description":"James Madison is leaving the Sun Belt Conference for the American Conference a year earlier than planned, in 2027 rather than 2028.","published":"2026-11-19T21:30:55.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50534149/james-madison-moving-american-conference-2027","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2027 NFL draft Big Board rankings: Mel Kiper's top 25 prospects, best by position","description":"Six quarterbacks and six receivers ranked in the top 25? Mel Kiper Jr. stacks the best players on the 2027 draft board as of mid-November.","published":"2026-11-19T22:42:53.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/draft2027/story/_/id/50182998/2027-nfl-draft-rankings-kiper-big-board-top-prospects","type":"Story","byline":"Mel Kiper Jr.","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Michigan WR Andrew Marsh facing misdemeanor indecent exposure charge","description":"Michigan receiver Andrew Marsh is facing a misdemeanor charge of indecent exposure stemming from a February incident involving a food service driver.","published":"2026-11-19T21:15:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50533990/michigan-wr-marsh-facing-misdemeanor-indecent-exposure-charge","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Which teams have the best odds to make the College Football Playoff?","description":"We are tracking the odds for making the CFP, earning a bye and winning it all.","published":"2026-11-19T21:22:13.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532919/college-football-playoff-odds-predictions","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN staff","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Hall of Famer Jack Ham returning to broadcast booth after health scare","description":"Hall of Fame linebacker and Penn State radio analyst Jack Ham will return to the broadcast booth on Saturday, just two weeks after suffering a medical emergency.","published":"2026-11-19T19:37:38.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532925/jack-ham-returning-broadcast-booth-health-scare","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"2026 'College GameDay' Week 12: Virginia Tech vs. Miami","description":"\"College GameDay\" heads to University of Miami for Week 12.","published":"2026-11-19T19:27:21.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50532540/2026-college-gameday-week-12-virginia-tech-vs-miami","type":"Story","byline":"ESPN","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Studies: Blood test has potential to detect CTE in the living","description":"A new blood test shows potential to detect advanced stages of chronic traumatic encephalopathy (CTE) in the living, according to two recent published studies.","published":"2026-11-19T22:37:56.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/nfl/story/_/id/50532686/studies-blood-test-potential-detect-cte-living","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Shwetha Surendran and Mark Fainaru-Wada","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What we learned about new NC State coach Philip Rivers in Fairhope, Alabama","description":"Rivers, the former NC State and NFL star quarterback, had been coaching high school football for six years.","published":"2026-11-19T12:19:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50514617/philip-rivers-nc-state-fairhope-alabama","type":"Story","byline":"Alex Scarborough","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/4899483/sammy-omosigho","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho"},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Sammy Omosigho","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sammy_Omosigho","description":"American football linebacker (born 2004)","touched":"2026-11-14T07:37:24Z","intro":"Samuel Omosigho (born September 17, 2004) is an American football linebacker for the UCLA Bruins. He previously played for the Oklahoma Sooners.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Omosigho attended Crandall High School in Crandall, Texas. Coming out of high school, he was rated as a four-star recruit, where he held offers from Florida, TCU, and Oklahoma. Ultimately, Omosigho committed to play college football for the Oklahoma Sooners."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first collegiate season at the University of Oklahoma in 2023, Omosigho played in 10 games, notching seven tackles with half a tackle for a loss. During the 2024 season, Omosigho played all 13 games, recording 39 tackles with five being for a loss, six pressures, a pass deflection, and a forced fumble.\nHeading into the 2025 season, he was named to the Butkus Award watch list and earned a starting spot at linebacker for the Sooners. In week one of the 2025 season, Omosigho totaled eight tackles and his first career sack in a season opening win over Illinois State. In week 12, he recorded six tackles and a fumble recovery in an upset win over Alabama.\nIn 2026, Omosigho transferred to the University of California, Los Angeles, to play for the Bruins. He was a first-team midseason All-American selection by the Associated Press and was named a semifinalist for the Butkus Award."}]}}